# surf-database-r2dbc's own shaded jar ships this descriptor with only the
# r2dbc-pool provider -- its shading overwrote the driver entries instead of
# merging them, so without this file no driver is discoverable and r2dbc fails
# with "Available drivers: [ None ]".
#
# This file shares its path with the one from that jar, so it replaces it rather
# than merging with it: list every provider, r2dbc-pool included.
#
# These names are deliberately un-shaded: shadowJar's mergeServiceFiles() rewrites
# them (and this file's name) to the relocated packages, so they stay correct if
# the relocation prefix changes.
io.r2dbc.postgresql.PostgresqlConnectionFactoryProvider
org.mariadb.r2dbc.MariadbConnectionFactoryProvider
io.r2dbc.pool.PoolingConnectionFactoryProvider
